// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P2552207055" "<em t=3>Well, science has invoked many ills upon society... <em t=4> Biotech Plagues... Cancer... Pollution... Genetic Mutations... The Crusades. <em t4> Wait, scratch the last one."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P2293090917" "And now I'll read from the teachings of Martin Henri."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P1778233641" "Here's an excerpt from the Codex Oranbegan, in which Father Gerard Henri casts the demon into the volcano."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P2023516522" "Now on page 14, we see another example of Dr. Aeon's wrath invoked on the innocents."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P3746572131" "Figure 1 shows the difference between a 'Good Protest' and a 'Bad Protest.' <em> The Bad Protest is the one with all of the head injuries."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P1018967322" "Illustration 4 is entitled 'How to go limp.'"
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P4278858778" "Father Henri's teachings are numerous, but I hold in this volume a collection most relevant to the evil that is Dr. Aeon."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P973413430" "The definition of non-violent action is a murky one, especially when dealing with Arachnos thugs..."
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P1779162777" "Mere protesting is not enough...  Dr. Aeon's thugs are powerful, but we will show them the wrongness of their ways!"
// CAP_TEACHER_INACTIVE :
"P2308133010" "You must shed all of the trappings of technology so as to understand just how de-humanized it has made us."

// CAP_TEACHER_ATTACK :
