// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3252124244" "Father Henri's journals are so relevant in this day and age."
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3389016081" "Tell us more."
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P2640781781" "Get to the bit about how it's all Dr. Aeon's fault!"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P3229374404" "I'm not sure we should be so vocal about Aeon here on his doorstep."
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P110280498" "More!"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
