// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P221387635" "What was the middle thing?"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_INACTIVE :
"P4065533066" "Does this mean I have to throw away my PSP?"

// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_ALERT :
"P1460195969" "Interloper!"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_ALERT :
"P2333069000" "These lessons are not for you!"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_ALERT :
"P396566870" "Interrupted again!"
// CAP_TEACHER_ENCOURAGE_ALERT :
"P3024621159" "Class dismissed."

// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2518501605" "Take a pamphlet, please."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2247989738" "Learn about Dr. Aeon's evil plans."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P164658427" "This flyer explains it all."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1982215063" "I need more pamphlets.  These are going fast."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2260796256" "Will no one take a flyer?"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2455843967" "Learn the truth about the PTS!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3419761129" "The Orange pipes are evil... this pamphlet explains it all."

// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1852009661" "Do not interrupt the free exchange of knowledge, fascist!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P638921647" "Oppressor!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P211574385" "Recluse's thug!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1140731087" "Help! Our rights are being stifled!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3622863989" "Why must you act as a tool of oppression?"

// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2648716645" "No one is going to read these."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3477065445" "Forget pamphleteering... Direct action is the answer."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4142988146" "C'mon... Learn the truth about Dr. Aeon!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1253127360" "They look like they need a good pamphletting."

// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P367375752" "Oh, yeah... Direct Action!"
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1614723590" "Time for a real protest."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2081036770" "Show them what for."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3859174227" "Drop those pamphlets and start fighting."
// CAP_AEON_PAMPHLET_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4273841218" "Time to educate!"

// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1396469525" "Aeon!  Your thugs cannot silence the truth!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3718059864" "Just say NO! to the Orange Pipes of Doom."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1954915773" "We will not go quietly!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3092601608" "The truth must be heard!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1990262987" "The soldiers of Martin Henri will speak the truth, and you will listen!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P120894384" "The PTS is an offense unto nature."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1435239981" "Join us and fight Aeon's villainous plans!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2507539403" "Free yourself from the evil shackles of Dr. Aeon's technology!"

// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1455047735" "Time for action!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2244730587" "The truth will always win out!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P820768009" "Time for a reality check."
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P282068332" "Silence is death!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2381632430" "We shall not be silenced!"
// CAP_AEON_SMALLPICKET_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3725538674" "Stop them!"

// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4154248378" "We need to get another good march going."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P612169509" "We must stop Aeon before he destroys us all."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1561568609" "I hear of insane things happening in Dr. Aeon's labs."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2117241458" "Never forget Father Henri's deeds."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4288053422" "Martin Henri is the light, the truth..."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1439062491" "The Truth will win out."

// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3369832025" "They must be shown the truth... no matter how much it hurts."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P618796021" "Uh-oh."
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P976656345" "Fight for truth!"
// CAP_AEON_CASUAL_LOITER_LUDDITE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2075695195" "Now is the time!"

// CAP_AEON_NOTETAKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1628056264" "Uh-oh... It's the Man."
// CAP_AEON_NOTETAKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1148902982" "They must be shown the truth... whatever it takes."
// CAP_AEON_NOTETAKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1934255983" "Your transgressions are noted."
// CAP_AEON_NOTETAKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3871329693" "Your picture is going in the next pamphlet!"

// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2104446889" "I'm glad you asked... Non-violent protest does not mean 'only knives.' "
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P693603835" "Dr. Aeon's so-called 'progress' is really a smoke screen hiding impending disaster."
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800880488" "We must stay strong in our fight to defeat the lies of Dr. Aeon."
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2021647994" "Remove the crust from your eyes!  Aeon's 'cheap' electricity comes at a great cost!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P412758403" "Dr. Aeon's geothermal plant on Mt. Diable hides a very sinister secret. Awake, people!  And know the truth..."
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1950270420" "The giant orange lines that Dr. Aeon has festooned our city with are supposedly filled with abundant electricity.  What they are filled with is, in fact ...evil!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3698686711" "The sheep who perform petty crimes for Lord Recluse in our fair isles are only a small part of the evil that we fight."
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1245802181" "The PTS--the orange pipes that mar the city--are the key to understanding the evil of Dr. Aeon."
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1621438262" "All of that practice-picketing in the woods will now pay off."

// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2068513933" "Time for Direct Action!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4275987191" "Our protest is now a Direct Action!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P806469519" "Fight the Man, my children!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3431655176" "Stay in formation!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1622719762" "We're not ready yet... Stay grouped, you fools!"
// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2100181381" "We should have practiced more out in the woods."

// CAP_AEON_LUDDITE_PROTEST_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3217457564" "Shhh... they'll hear us."

// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P357893963" "I know that information campaigns and peaceful protests are the way of Martin Henri.... But sometimes I just want to hurt these 'villains.'"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P511332434" "Learn the truth!  The Power Transfer System is a pipeline to Hell!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1703566497" "Protesting is hard work...  I'm pooped."
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1912916649" "Keep on walking, lemming!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2739222208" "I wish we could sit further from those orange pipes..."
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P652930073" "We will educate you all, whether you want to hear it or not!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4027157716" "Paragon city doesn't have all these problems, but I betcha they benefit from Aeon's inventions too."
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2188992089" "No one is innocent!"

// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P768423706" "Here we go."
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3332805344" "Yay! Time to 'teach' some lemmings!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2396397129" "Martin Henri is the leader! Martin Henri is great!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3447223227" "We didn't learn this in resistance boot camp!"

// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4008278359" "Keep alert! Recluse's sheep might be listening."
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3575039065" "Shh! There are villains everywhere. Why do you think they call this place the 'City of Villains?'"
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1437432581" "Wish I had some pamphlets."
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2515111866" "Maybe we should start a sticker and t-shirt campaign."

// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2327897921" "Heads up!"
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P957150043" "Form a wedge!  Incoming!"
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// CAP_WANDER_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P614075159" "I wish I was back on the protest line."

// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2554990497" "All technology has its problems, but this mill with its hypersaws is particularly evil."
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1160675977" "We will strike the heart of these workers with our message!"
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P73579323" "Businesses like these thrive on the demonic power provided by the PTS! Time to shut them down!"
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P518964955" "See how the workers flee!  They are learning Truth!"
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3011439376" "The mill here in Devil's Coat Tails is just the beginning of the foul technologies that plague this place."

// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1267078793" "I'm all out of rhetoric... Time to fight!"
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P857648410" "A pamphlet can only go so far... Fight!"
// CAP_DCT_LUDDITE_SOAPBOX_ALERT_TEXT :
"P915945091" "We will not disperse quietly!"

// CAP_LUDDITE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3669084749" "Keep your eyes open.  Arachnos thugs could be anywhere."
// CAP_LUDDITE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2531365865" "I hate walking these areas.  I feel so vulnerable."
// CAP_LUDDITE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2872429258" "I'm glad our message is starting to become more... proactive.  I am so tired of just taking the beatings from Arachnos."
// CAP_LUDDITE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4122750698" "I hear we are making good progress on our information distribution scheme.  I see the pamphlets in the hands of the unenlightened."
// CAP_LUDDITE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759900149" "If we stand as a group, we just might be able to live long enough to spread the word of Martin Henri!"


// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046274092" "Why are we doing this you ask? One word - Sabotage"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1125886208" "This is no petty vandalism.  We do Martin Henri's work."
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3103136285" "The demonic machines that lurk within these walls will soon be destroyed!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2636462108" "Aeon's stooges are in for a rude morning when they find all of their infernal machines smashed in the night."
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2966226394" "Work harder!  We must get through this barrier if we are to come to the smashing part of our direct action campaign!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1595929917" "I know it is wrong, but this would be a lot easier with some modern tools."

// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P394289107" "We do good deeds here! You shall not interfere!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2428429511" "Scatter, my pupils!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1656917209" "Intruders!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4133295746" "Why must you interfere!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P827998108" "Dang, interrupted again!"
// CAP_LUDDITE_BREAKIN_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P547232010" "We will never get through the barrier at this rate!"

